; In-tree unit + property tests for smt/theories/euf. Depends only on oxsmt_core
; and oxsmt_euf, so it honors the dependency firewall (I3) even though it lives
; under smt/. Run via `make euf-test`; also built by `make build`.
;
; The naive quadratic congruence closure here is deliberately test-only and written
; from the EUF spec alone (DESIGN §10): it shares no code with the engine's
; union-find / explanation forest / congruence table.

(executable
 (name euf_test)
 (modules euf_test)
 (libraries oxsmt_core oxsmt_euf))

; Adversarial tests for the ADR-0005 THEORY adapter (Euf_adapter): drives the frozen
; THEORY surface and cross-checks against the same kind of independent naive closure.
; Same firewall (oxsmt_core + oxsmt_euf only). Run via `make euf-adapter-test`.

(executable
 (name euf_adapter_test)
 (modules euf_adapter_test)
 (libraries oxsmt_core oxsmt_euf))
